    // reading rows of E and columns of F. Within each tile:
    //   for each row ii inside tile:
    //     for each k:
    //       load/use E(i, k) (contiguous in k)
    //       for each li in tile (vectorized):
    //         G(i,l) += E(i,k) * F(l,k)
    //
